      384.57,
      230.75
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE DR. SAMAN WEERASINGHEFOUNDATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      248.81,
      401.89,
      333.71
    ],
    "text": "WHERE a Board called and known as the \u201cDr. SamanWeerasinghe Foundation\u201d has heretofore been establishin Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying outand transacting all objects and matters connected withthe said Foundation according to the rules agreed to by itsmembers:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      351.77,
      401.9,
      421.91
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Organization has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the objects and mattersfor which it was formed and has applied to be incorporatedand it will be for the public advantage to grant suchapplication:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      439.97,
      401.89,
      465.95
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      484.01,
      401.86,
      510.11
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Dr. Saman WeerasingheFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      528.17,
      401.9,
      671.75
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so may persons as now are members of the\u201cDr. Saman Weerasinghe Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted asmembers shall be a body corporate (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetual succession under the nameand style of \u201cDr. Saman Weerasinghe Foundation\u201d and bythat name may sue and be sued in all Courts, with full powerand authority to have and use a common seal and to alter thesame at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      249.55,
      442.29,
      258.62
    ],
    "text": "Preamble.",
