      157.15,
      202.97,
      397.17,
      226.31
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.87,
      238.97,
      397.18,
      262.31
    ],
    "text": "(a) to provide advice and support for all communitiesin Sri Lanka to live in peace and harmony;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.87,
      274.97,
      397.19,
      298.31
    ],
    "text": "(b) to provide facilities to pre-school children and grantscholarship to them;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      176.71,
      310.97,
      397.17,
      334.31
    ],
    "text": "(c) to provide facilities to safeguard and maintain ethicsand culture;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.87,
      346.97,
      397.17,
      370.31
    ],
    "text": "(d) to supply the necessary equipments and facilities ofthe poor school children to develop their studies;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      176.71,
      382.97,
      397.2,
      406.31
    ],
    "text": "(e) to provide medical and food to the poor, the destituteand the sick;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      178.15,
      418.97,
      397.18,
      442.31
    ],
    "text": "(f) to establish libraries to promote education andresearch;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.87,
      454.97,
      397.16,
      478.31
    ],
    "text": "(g) to work towards to protect and develop all rights ofwomen and children;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.87,
      490.97,
      397.2,
      514.31
    ],
    "text": "(h) to protect and make known human rights, humanitiesand fundamental rights;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      178.15,
      526.97,
      337.88,
      538.31
    ],
    "text": "(i) to organize leadership programmes;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      178.15,
      550.97,
      397.21,
      586.31
    ],
    "text": "(j) to liaise and co-ordinate with other local and foreigninstructions or foundations which have similarobjects.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      598.97,
      397.19,
      670.55
    ],
