    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      202.73,
      401.9,
      249.23
    ],
    "text": "(2) The first Board of the Corporation shall consist of themembers of the Board of administration of the Foundationholding office on the day immediately preceding the date ofcommencement of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      261.29,
      401.9,
      389.63
    ],
    "text": "5.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts, matters and things whatso ever as are necessary or desirable for the promotion orfurtherance of the objects of the Corporation or any one ofthem, including the power to acquire and hold propertymoveable, to open, operate and close bank accounts, toborrow or raise moneys with or without security, to erect anybuilding or structures on any land held by the Corporationand to engage, employ and dismiss officers and servantsrequired for the carrying out of the objects of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      401.69,
      401.94,
      471.47
    ],
    "text": "6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, from timeto time, at any General Meeting of the members and by amajority of not less than two-thirds of the members presentand voting, to make rules, not inconsistent with theprovisions of this Act or any other written law, for all or anyof the following matters:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      483.53,
      401.88,
      518.27
    ],
    "text": "(a) classification of membership, admission,withdrawal, expulsion or resignation of membersand membership fees payable;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      530.33,
      401.86,
      588.47
    ],
    "text": "(b) procedure to be observed for the summoning andholding of meetings of the Corporation and of theBoard of Directors, the quorum of such meetingsand the exercise and performance of their powersand duties;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      181.29,
      600.53,
      401.86,
      635.27
    ],
    "text": "(c) the appointment, power, duties and functions of thevarious officers, agents and servants of theCorporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      647.33,
      401.88,
      670.43
    ],
    "text": "(d) qualification required to become a member of theCorporation and of the Board of Directors; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      261.31,
      455.85,
